<title>CHILE: Cristalerias 1996 profits narrowly higher.</title>
<headline>Cristalerias 1996 profits narrowly higher.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glassmaker and cable TV operator Cristalerias de Chile SA reported 1996 net earnings of 11.01 billion pesos, up two percent over 1995, and fourth quarter net earnings of 3.64 billion pesos, up 40 percent from the same quarter 1995.</p>
<p>The figures were contained in a press statement from the company, which did not give comparative 1995 figures.</p>
<p>It said consolidated sales were 82.83 billion pesos last year, with operating results of 13.95 billion pesos and a non- operating loss of 876 million pesos.</p>
<p>It said 1995 sales figures were not strictly comparable because of the company's purchase of winery Vina Santa Rita last year.</p>
<p>((-- Roger Atwood, Santiago newsroom +56-2-699-5595 x211))</p>
